[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 454 - Lifelink on infect damage
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Hard
Description:It is your first main phase. You are at 3 life. You control Phyrexian Crusader (2/2 first strike, infect) equipped with Basilisk Collar (deathtouch and lifelink) and an untapped Wastes, and have Dismember ({1}{B/P}{B/P}) in hand. The opponent is at 20 life and controls a tapped Serra Angel. Destroy the Serra Angel this turn and stay alive.
Rule:authored-lifelink-infect | Infect damage to a player gives poison counters instead of life loss, but it is still damage, so lifelink gains that much life (CR 702.90b, 702.15b): attack to go to 5 life, then Dismember for {C} and 4 life leaves you at 1; at 3 life you can't pay both Phyrexian symbols
